```kotlin
pluginManagement {
    repositories {
        google()
        mavenCentral()
        gradlePluginPortal()
    }
}

dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.FAIL_ON_PROJECT_REPOS)

    repositories {
        google()
        mavenCentral()
    }
}

rootProject.name = "Caroline"

include(":app")
```

Place it here:

```text
Caroline/
├── settings.gradle.kts
├── version.properties
├── build.gradle.kts
└── app/
    ├── build.gradle.kts
    └── src/
```
